---
title: mas-engineer-root
name: mas-engineer-root
description: Root recipe for MAS-Engineer
version: 1.0
constitution: sub_mas-master-constitution.yaml
instructions: |
  # Root Recipe — MAS-Engineer Entry Point

  STEP 1 — Load the mas-engineer recipe system
    The root recipe delegates to the main dev-mas-engineer orchestrator
    which handles all MAS operations.

  STEP 2 — Delegate to orchestrator
    Use delegate(source: "dev-mas-engineer") to start the full MAS-Engineer
    system with all 96 sub-agents and 57 tools.

  STEP 3 — Report status
    Return status to the caller with any relevant observations.
prompt: |
  I am mas-engineer-root (v1.0.0) | MODE-CHECK: mas-engineer
  ⛔ ONLY orchestration — NO direct execution
  → Delegate to sub-agents via dev-mas-engineer
settings:
  model: sonnet
  temperature: 0.3
  timeout: 300
extensions: []
---
name: MAS Generic Init
version: 1.0.0
constitution: sub_mas-master-constitution.yaml
title: 🌍 GENERIC-INIT (v1.0.0)
description: v3.0.0 | NO agent copies — symlink + guidelines + remote analysis
instructions: '# Extended instructions: recipe/instructions/sub_mas-generic-init.md


  Full instructions outsourced to external file for maintainability.


  ## Loading

  All detailed workflows, examples, and rules are in the external file. This recipe
  contains only the role, prompt, and configuration.


  ## Read external file FIRST

  Before any action, read: `recipe/instructions/sub_mas-generic-init.md`

  '
prompt: 'I am generic-init (v1.0.0) | MODE-CHECK: mas-engineer | 🌍 GENERIC-INIT (v1.0.0)
  ⛔ Only initialize — NO changes to existing projects. → See MASTER-CONSTITUTION Art.
  1-6'
sub_recipes:
  - name: sub_mas-web-researcher
    path: ./sub_mas-web-researcher.yaml
    description: Search for current best-practices
  - name: sub_mas-recipe-designer
    path: ./sub_mas-recipe-designer.yaml
    description: Design new agent recipes (task=CONCEIVE)
  - name: sub_mas-team-packager
    path: ./sub_mas-team-packager.yaml
    description: Package teams as standalone goose-installable dirs
settings:
  timeout: 600
  max_steps: 100
  goose_provider: openai
  goose_model: deepseek-v4-flash
  temperature: 0.3
extensions:
- type: platform
  name: summon
- type: builtin
  name: developer
  display_name: Developer
  timeout: 300
  bundled: true